Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 13:53:07 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] nacm BUGFIX apply filters after applying NACM

As per NACM spec to avoid leaking inaccessible
information.

Upstream: https://github.com/sysrepo/sysrepo/commit/d943e72f107f83601b64d5aa3186ec9d65a23d24
Signed-off-by: Mattias Walström <lazzer@gmail.com>
